{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The scatterplot shows the relationship between the number of swans, <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>, in a certain population and the number of years since <math alttext=\"1970\"><mn>1970</mn></math>, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"0 less than or equals x less than or equals 50\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>50</mn></math>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg version=\"1.0.0\" width=\"370px\" height=\"325.328125px\" viewBox=\"0 0 370 325.328125\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"A scatterplot in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 50. The y axis ranges from 0 to 300. Refer to long description.\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 -3 10 6\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10px\" markerHeight=\"6px\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,-3 L10,0 L0,3\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></marker></defs><g class=\"graph-group\" transform=\"translate(57, 25)\"><g class=\"grid-group\"><g class=\"x-grid\"><line x1=\"0.5\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"0.5\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"0.5\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"0.5\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"51.710156250000004\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"51.710156250000004\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"102.92031250000001\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"102.92031250000001\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"154.13046875\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"154.13046875\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"205.34062500000002\" y1=\"279.328125\" x2=\"205.34062500000002\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><